# Build artifacts from ti/build_ti.{ps1,sh} and the CMake stub build.
# The TI build drops a ~14 MB .out and a ~2 MB .map here; none of it belongs
# in history (the shippable image is signed and published under prebuilt/).
build/

# Cygwin/MSYS crash dumps.  The Windows bench shell drops these in the repo
# root and `git add -A` has swept them into history more than once.
*.stackdump
